WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.031 --> 00:00:04.195
Wukong and Bajie flew away from the jail quickly.

2
00:00:04.196 --> 00:00:09.874
They left Metro City and were soon drifting high above the mountains.

3
00:00:09.875 --> 00:00:15.094
They landed in an open meadow.

4
00:00:15.095 --> 00:00:19.875
"Well, Wukong," Bajie said, "I'm glad you found me.

5
00:00:19.876 --> 00:00:24.329
I was afraid I'd be stuck alone in this world."

6
00:00:24.330 --> 00:00:27.762
"It's good to see you, Bajie," Wukong said.

7
00:00:27.763 --> 00:00:38.042
"I need a nap," Bajie said, lying down. "Then we should return to Master."

8
00:00:38.043 --> 00:00:43.555
"Do you notice anything odd?" Wukong asked, looking around at the meadow and mountains.

9
00:00:43.556 --> 00:00:47.927
"Not really," Bajie said and closed his eyes.

10
00:00:47.928 --> 00:00:53.448
"These mountains resemble the mountains we're traveling through with Master," Wukong said.

11
00:00:53.449 --> 00:00:58.673
"But there's one big difference—there are no demons here."

12
00:00:58.674 --> 00:01:02.964
"How do you know that?" Bajie asked with a snort.

13
00:01:02.965 --> 00:01:07.719
"I can see really far, and I can sense demons," Wukong said. "I

14
00:01:07.720 --> 00:01:11.620
just realized I haven't sensed any demons since I arrived. Maybe

15
00:01:11.621 --> 00:01:14.472
we should stay here for a little while." "I

16
00:01:14.473 --> 00:01:19.029
don't like this world," Bajie said, scowling. "They

17
00:01:19.030 --> 00:01:26.405
put me in jail, and for what? Because I ate a little bit of food—bah!" Wukong

18
00:01:26.406 --> 00:01:28.559
tapped his chin. "What

19
00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:33.180
if we take over this place? That way they can't put you back in jail. And

20
00:01:33.181 --> 00:01:37.237
we'll get a break from fighting demons." "I

21
00:01:37.238 --> 00:01:43.513
like that idea, but there's one person here who's pretty powerful." Wukong

22
00:01:43.514 --> 00:01:48.301
raised an eyebrow. "Do you mean Rocket Girl?" "Did

23
00:01:48.302 --> 00:01:50.877
you meet her?" Bajie asked. Wukong

24
00:01:50.878 --> 00:01:58.317
nodded. "She's powerful, but she's not here anymore—I sent her to our world." "Good

25
00:01:58.318 --> 00:02:03.109
work!" Bajie said with a laugh. "So

26
00:02:03.110 --> 00:02:12.017
let's take over this place. We'll boss everyone around and eat all their food." "We're

27
00:02:12.018 --> 00:02:16.653
going to need an army to take over the kingdom," Wukong said thoughtfully. "I'll

28
00:02:16.654 --> 00:02:20.595
make a quick trip back to the Fruit and Flower Mountain." ***

29
00:02:20.596 --> 00:02:28.775
"Watch this." Jack jumped off his sofa and started spinning around, kicking and throwing punches.

30
00:02:28.776 --> 00:02:30.877
"I'm the monkey!"

31
00:02:30.878 --> 00:02:35.331
Mara laughed and snorted.

32
00:02:35.332 --> 00:02:45.846
"Look at me—I'm the pig!" She let out a big burp.

33
00:02:45.847 --> 00:02:52.041
While Jack and Mara laughed, Terrell sneaked out of the room.

34
00:02:52.042 --> 00:02:57.215
He pulled out his phone and called Roxy, but she still didn't answer.

35
00:02:57.216 --> 00:03:02.471
"Where is she?" Terrell wondered with a sigh.

36
00:03:02.472 --> 00:03:06.039
"And why won't she answer my calls?"

37
00:03:06.040 --> 00:03:10.678
*** "Open up this door, Demon!" Roxy

38
00:03:10.679 --> 00:03:15.198
shouted. She punched and kicked the cave's door, yelling all sorts of terrible things.

39
00:03:15.199 --> 00:03:22.905
Finally the Demon of Black Rain opened the door. "Why are you still here?"

40
00:03:22.906 --> 00:03:28.375
"Release those prisoners right now!" Roxy yelled, stamping her foot.

41
00:03:28.376 --> 00:03:32.284
"No!" The demon glared at Roxy.

42
00:03:32.285 --> 00:03:40.467
"You're a rude person! I'm trying to rest, and you're banging on my door and yelling mean things!"

43
00:03:40.468 --> 00:03:44.848
Whiz-hoo! Roxy's eye laser beams zapped the demon's face.

44
00:03:44.849 --> 00:03:49.271
"Ouch!" The demon threw a punch.

45
00:03:49.272 --> 00:03:53.578
Roxy leaped out of the way. "Ha! You missed—"

46
00:03:53.579 --> 00:03:58.882
Whoosh! Wind and rain swept Roxy away again.

47
00:03:58.883 --> 00:04:03.287
She tumbled down the side of the mountain, crashing through shrubs.

48
00:04:03.288 --> 00:04:06.672
Finally she landed at the bottom of the mountain.

49
00:04:06.673 --> 00:04:14.319
Up above, the cave's door slammed shut.

50
00:04:14.320 --> 00:04:19.931
"Grr!" Roxy was about to fly back up the mountain.

51
00:04:19.932 --> 00:04:22.511
Suddenly an old woman appeared.

52
00:04:22.512 --> 00:04:29.891
"Don't go back up there!"

